<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Elec shares up on hope of higher profits.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Elec shares up on hope of higher profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd climbed in Thursday afternoon trade, helped by growing hopes of higher earnings for the company in the latter half of this business year, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0515 GMT, the electric parts maker's share price was up 50 yen at 2,090 yen, on volume of 1.15 million shares.</p>
<p>Traders said the number of new orders seemed to have stopped reducing in October, which is likely to help the firm's operating profits to grow.</p>
</text>
